{
  "id": "p13",
  "title": "The Factory Sale",
  "titleZh": "工厂出售",
  "topic": "小镇",
  "paragraphs": [
    [
      {
        "en": "Who do you think will buy the old factory by the river?",
        "zh": "你觉得今年春天谁会买下河边的老工厂？"
      },
      {
        "en": "Now a small crowd waits between the front gate and the low wall.",
        "zh": "现在一小群人等在正门和矮墙之间。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My hands put the new sign beside the old problem list on the door.",
        "zh": "我用双手把新牌子挂在门边那张旧问题清单旁边。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Four families live in a small, quiet house near the river bank.",
        "zh": "四户人家住在河边一栋安静的小房子里。"
      },
      {
        "en": "This change brings a clear result for every tired worker.",
        "zh": "这一变化给每个疲惫的工人都带来了明确的结果。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then together they suggest a short walk outside the gate.",
        "zh": "然后他们一起提议到门外安静地走一小段。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Our position is safe, though the road stays busy all day.",
        "zh": "我们的位置很安全，尽管这条路整天都很忙。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The old industry may return to this small southern town.",
        "zh": "这个老行业也许会回到这座小小的南方城镇。"
      },
      {
        "en": "We share the news and learn about the old machines.",
        "zh": "我们分享消息，也了解了那些旧机器。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Then fifty people stand at the top of the wide stone stairs.",
        "zh": "然后五十个人站在宽阔石阶的顶端。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "The sale will use the old hall for a month or more.",
        "zh": "这次出售会让这座旧礼堂再用一个月甚至更久。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Sometimes a warm wind comes from the south at night.",
        "zh": "有时夜里会从南边吹来一阵暖风。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The population near the station grows a little each year.",
        "zh": "车站附近的人口每年都增长一点。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Science nearly solves the old puzzle of the dirty water.",
        "zh": "科学几乎解开了脏水这个老谜题。"
      },
      {
        "en": "They mention the rough surface and the likely cause.",
        "zh": "他们提到粗糙的路面，也提到可能的原因。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A hot steam pipe runs through a quarter of the small room.",
        "zh": "一根滚烫的蒸汽管穿过小房间的四分之一。"
      },
      {
        "en": "My small newspaper prints the story at great speed today.",
        "zh": "我的小报纸今天以极快的速度印出这条新闻。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Later somebody leads a short tour through the silent plant.",
        "zh": "后来有人带着大家穿过安静的厂区做了一次短途参观。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A bright light burns above the little store on the corner.",
        "zh": "一盏明亮的灯在小店上方的角落里亮着。"
      },
      {
        "en": "One small mistake makes the old editor ill for a week.",
        "zh": "一个小错误让老编辑病了一个星期。"
      }
    ],
    [
      {
        "en": "My brother and I know the boys kick a ball behind the wooden shed.",
        "zh": "我哥哥和我知道那些男孩在木棚后面踢球。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The library sits far from the loud traffic of the main road.",
        "zh": "图书馆离大路上嘈杂的交通很远。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A deep silence fills the yard when the machines shut down.",
        "zh": "机器一关，院子里就一片深深的寂静。"
      },
      {
        "en": "A funny drawing covers every inch of the long back wall.",
        "zh": "一幅好笑的画占满了后墙的每一英寸。"
      },
      {
        "en": "His long illness makes it hard to breathe at night.",
        "zh": "他长久的病让他在夜里很难呼吸。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Whenever we pass the plain, the sky looks wide and clear.",
        "zh": "每当我们经过那片平原，天空就显得又宽又清。"
      },
      {
        "en": "Fresh potato soup with butter warms the whole tired team.",
        "zh": "新鲜的土豆汤加上黄油，暖了整支疲惫的队伍。"
      },
      {
        "en": "The smart buyer calls afterwards about the sudden takeover.",
        "zh": "那位聪明的买家随后打来电话，谈这笔突然的接管。"
      }
    ]
  ],
